Algebraic identity (exact, symbolic via Fraction at sampled w): 14j-D=14(w/13)-(w+1)
 =(14w-13w-13)/13=(w-13)/13 >0 for w>13; so j>=D/14 strictly. Mechanism = w in 182Z.
